{"id":"n65154-1-7","stage":1,"title":"숟가락 · 勺子","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65154-1-7-1","ko":"숟가락이 없는데 국을 어떻게 먹지?","zh":"没有勺子，要怎么喝汤呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"숟가락이","meaning":"勺子，勺儿，汤匙，调羹","explanation":"숟가락：勺子，勺儿，汤匙，调羹；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"숟가락","audio":"/audio/de5bf362af500903e570.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65154","senseId":"1","lemma":"숟가락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없는데","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"국을","meaning":"汤","explanation":"국：汤；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"국","audio":"/audio/8178f6b3db96ee306d49.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36778","senseId":"1","lemma":"국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹지?","meaning":"喝","explanation":"먹다：喝；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"2","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"de5bf362af500903","term":"숟가락","zh":"勺子，勺儿，汤匙，调羹","audio":"/audio/de5bf362af500903e570.mp3","entryId":"65154","definition":"由圆形凹陷的部分和长手柄构成的器具，用来舀饭或汤等。","pronunciation":["숟까락"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"8178f6b3db96ee30","term":"국","zh":"汤","audio":"/audio/8178f6b3db96ee306d49.mp3","entryId":"36778","definition":"在肉类、鱼类或蔬菜等上倒入大量的水而煮成的食物。","pronunciation":["국"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"喝","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将液体状的东西咽下去。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4c6792e5bda83961c12d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65154-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 그냥 대접째 들고 마셔.","zh":"那就直接端着碗喝吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대접째","meaning":"大碗 ，平碗","explanation":"대접：大碗 ，平碗；째：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"대접","audio":"/audio/5bf2e92502fa8b17a9c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47069","senseId":"1","lemma":"대접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들고","meaning":"带，提，拎","explanation":"들다：带，提，拎；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마셔.","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"5bf2e92502fa8b17","term":"대접","zh":"大碗 ，平碗","audio":"/audio/5bf2e92502fa8b17a9c1.mp3","entryId":"47069","definition":"盛放汤或水等时使用的宽碗。","pronunciation":["대ː접"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"带，提，拎","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"手里拿着。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6194988b2ac6eade4332.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65154","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":42,"sequenceScore":1.9134,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没有勺子，要怎么喝汤呢？","那就直接端着碗喝吧。","你把头抬起来看看。是哪里受伤了啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没有勺子，要怎么喝汤呢？","那就直接端着碗喝吧。","你把头抬起来看看。是哪里受伤了啊？"],"answer":1}]}
